            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Cauterization in horses is a painful method to enable the identification of horses. This method is not allowed (section 17 Nr. 2b Tierschutzgesetz, FRG), because recent findings have found a painless method to identify horses.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
